</td></table>
<table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td nowrap>
<font size=3 color=#606060><strong>▽</strong> 2004/04/25 (日) 23:00:37 <strong>▽</strong> <a href="mailto:gensan@k8.dion.ne.jp">驟雨</a> </font></td>
<td nowrap align=right><font size=3>　<a href="bbs.cgi?res=200404250230037&log=cluster">返信</a>　削除<input type=checkbox name="target" value="200404250230037"></font>
